{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the first n even natural numbers, each raised to the fifth power.\n    The sum is S(n) = sum_{k=1..n} (2k)^5.\n\n    Uses the closed-form formula for sum of fifth powers for O(1) computation:\n      sum_{k=1..n} k^5 = n^2 (n+1)^2 (2n^2 + 2n - 1) / 12\n    Therefore S(n) = 32 * sum_{k=1..n} k^5\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"n must be an integer\")\n    if n < 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be >= 1\")\n\n    # Using the formula: S(n) = 32 * n^2 * (n+1)^2 * (2n^2 + 2n - 1) / 12\n    nn = n\n    part = nn * nn * (nn + 1) * (nn + 1) * (2 * nn * nn + 2 * nn - 1)\n    return 32 * (part // 12)"}
