{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits for each number in a given list, summing the absolute values of digits.\n    Returns the total sum of all digits across all numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum_of_all_digits = 0\n\n    def _sum_digits_of_single_number(n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Helper to calculate the sum of digits for a single integer, using its absolute value.\"\"\"\n        s = 0\n        n_abs = abs(n)\n        if n_abs == 0:\n            return 0\n        while n_abs > 0:\n            s += n_abs % 10\n            n_abs //= 10\n        return s\n\n    for num in numbers:\n        total_sum_of_all_digits += _sum_digits_of_single_number(num)\n\n    return total_sum_of_all_digits"}
