{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple is smaller than its corresponding element in the first tuple.\n    Assumes tuples are of the same length and contain comparable numeric elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    return all(val_b < val_a for val_a, val_b in zip(a, b))"}
